{
  "slug": "founder-mode",
  "name": "Founder Mode",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A Claude Code plugin that extends claude code from coding tool to AI co-founder. 12 slash commands that encode the operating system behind Airbnb's pandemic-era transformation, grounded in 6 primary sources from Chesky, Paul Graham, and YC.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **12 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (12): `add-a-zero` (Force 10x thinking on any goal using Brian Chesky's \"Add a Zero\" exercise), `bureaucracy-detector` (Score any process, workflow, or meeting for bureaucrat-mode creep), `crisis-catalyst` (Reframe a crisis, constraint, or setback as a forcing function for founder-mode decisions that were previously politically blocked), `decision-check` (Determine whether a decision is a founder-only move (requires institutional memory, passion, and permission) or a manageable decision…), `delegation-scorer` (Score whether a delegation decision is healthy (amplifying what you love) or harmful (abdicating what you don't understand)), `founder-audit` (Diagnose where you sit on the founder mode vs), `founder-quiz` (Take a behavioral self-assessment to discover where you sit on the founder mode spectrum), `hiring-scorecard` (Score an executive or senior hire using Brian Chesky's 'guilty until proven innocent' framework), and 4 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install founder-mode@claude-community` from `sohaibt/founder-mode`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
